  "sourceSummary": "CriticalBody James Jackson original wide-grip pushdown instructions: long straight bar on high pulley, overhand grip, slight hip hinge, controlled press and return. Wrist/elbow alignment with a wider grip rather than extreme ends; no muscle-head specialization adopted. Source full lockout is represented with approximately5degree soft finish.",
